'''Martin''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Tomb Floodway}}.

== Purpose ==
'''Martin''' talks about how [[Fishing]] in the {{Zone|Tomb Floodway}} allows the player to avoid catching [[Sea Creatures]]. He also says that rare materials for top-quality [[Fishing Nets]] can be caught there, referring to {{Item|Flexbone}}s.

